  "detail_text": "The Office of Program Management and Policy, part of the Bureau of Administration's Office of Logistics Management (A/LM/PMP), is looking to procure barcodes from a leading company that specializes in the design and manufacture of durable, preprinted barcode labels. These barcodes must be versatile enough for use in both office and residential settings, and they should be durable enough to withstand various climates, including, but not limited to, tropical, desert, temperate, mountain, continental, polar, and tundra environments.",
